@StudentApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### 1. Get All Students
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Student By ID
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add Student
POST {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "age": 22
}

### 4. Update Student
PUT {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Updated",
  "email": "john.updated@example.com",
  "age": 23
}

### 5. Delete Student
DELETE {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Student/1
Accept: application/json


### 6. Get All SAP Vendors
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Vendor
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get SAP Vendor By Code
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/Vendor/VOS00102
Accept: application/json


### 8. Get All Open Purchase Orders
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/PurchaseOrder/open
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Open Purchase Orders for Specific Vendor
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/PurchaseOrder/open?vendorCode=VRM00001
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Purchase Order Details by DocEntry
GET {{StudentApi_HostAddress}}/api/PurchaseOrder/1
Accept: application/json
